Changed: Triangulation now stores the refinement of each object as a
RefinementChoice. As a result, serialized Triangulations which contain refined
tetrahedra created with previous versions of deal.II can no longer be loaded.
Furthermore, CellAccessor::set_refine_flag() which takes a RefinementCase no
longer has a default argument: instead, the new overload without arguments
flags a cell for isotropic refinement.
<br>
(David Wells, 2026/11/14)
